   "dur": 1.872,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 2.567
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "51% 攻击分四步。",
   "spoken": "百分之 51 攻击分四步。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-01.mp3",
   "start": 3.692,
   "dur": 2.88,
   "speechStart": 3.79,
   "speechEnd": 5.742
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "攻击者在交易所充值一大笔币，同时私下挖一条不包含这笔充值的链。",
   "spoken": "攻击者在交易所充值一大笔币，同时私下挖一条不包含这笔充值的链。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-02.mp3",
   "start": 6.792,
   "dur": 6.072,
   "speechStart": 6.89,
   "speechEnd": 12.044
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "交易所等够确认数入账，他把币卖掉，提走别的资产。",
   "spoken": "交易所等够确认数入账，他把币卖掉，提走别的资产。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-03.mp3",
   "start": 13.084,
   "dur": 4.944,
   "speechStart": 13.182,
   "speechEnd": 17.182
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "然后他公开私下那条更长的链，网络发生重组。",
   "spoken": "然后他公开私下那条更长的链，网络发生虫组。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-04.mp3",
   "start": 18.248,
   "dur": 4.872,
   "speechStart": 18.346,
   "speechEnd": 22.298
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "充值交易消失，币回到他手里，交易所账上多出一笔不存在的充值。",
   "spoken": "充值交易消失，币回到他手里，交易所账上多出一笔不存在的充值。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-05.mp3",
   "start": 23.34,
   "dur": 5.976,
   "speechStart": 23.438,
   "speechEnd": 28.485
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "再猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "再猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-06.mp3",
   "start": 29.536,
   "dur": 2.04,
   "speechStart": 29.634,
   "speechEnd": 30.741
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "攻击者有 60% 算力，确认数从 6 提高到 600，成功概率降多少？",
   "spoken": "攻击者有百分之 60 算力，确认数从 6 提高到 600，成功概率降多少？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-07.mp3",
   "start": 31.796,
   "dur": 6.384,
   "speechStart": 31.894,
   "speechEnd": 37.334
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "答案是不降。",
   "spoken": "答案是不降。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-08.mp3",
   "start": 38.68,
   "dur": 1.872,
   "speechStart": 38.778,
   "speechEnd": 39.635
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "算力超过一半，攻击者最终一定能追上。",
   "spoken": "算力超过一半，攻击者最终一定能追上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-09.mp3",
   "start": 40.772,
   "dur": 3.816,
   "speechStart": 40.87,
   "speechEnd": 43.751
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "加确认数，只增加他租算力的时间和成本。",
   "spoken": "加确认数，只增加他租算力的时间和成本。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-10.mp3",
   "start": 44.808,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 44.906,
   "speechEnd": 48.048
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "所以小算力链的确认数，是一个经济问题。",
   "spoken": "所以小算力链的确认数，是一个经济问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-11.mp3",
   "start": 49.108,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 49.206,
   "speechEnd": 52.837
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "租算力的成本，必须高于能双花的金额。",
   "spoken": "租算力的成本，必须高于能双花的金额。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-12.mp3",
   "start": 53.888,
   "dur": 3.768,
   "speechStart": 53.986,
   "speechEnd": 56.831
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "2019 年 1 月，Ethereum Classic 被深度重组和双花，约 110 万美元。",
   "spoken": "2019 年 1 月，Ethereum Classic 被深度虫组和双花，约 110 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-13.mp3",
   "start": 57.876,
   "dur": 6.624,
   "speechStart": 57.974,
   "speechEnd": 63.664
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "Coinbase 发现后，暂停了 ETC 的收付。",
   "spoken": "Coinbase 发现后，暂停了 ETC 的收付。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-14.mp3",
   "start": 64.72,
   "dur": 3.48,
   "speechStart": 64.818,
   "speechEnd": 67.353
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "2020 年 8 月，它一个月内被攻击三次，第一次双花约 560 万美元。",
   "spoken": "2020 年 8 月，它一个月内被攻击三次，第一次双花约 560 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-15.mp3",
   "start": 68.42,
   "dur": 6.12,
   "speechStart": 68.518,
   "speechEnd": 73.696
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "之后，Coinbase 把 ETC 的充值确认时间，提高到约两周。",
   "spoken": "之后，Coinbase 把 ETC 的充值确认时间，提高到约两周。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-16.mp3",
   "start": 74.76,
   "dur": 5.664,
   "speechStart": 74.858,
   "speechEnd": 79.596
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "多数算力，也不一定要持续拥有。",
   "spoken": "多数算力，也不一定要持续拥有。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-17.mp3",
   "start": 80.644,
   "dur": 3.336,
   "speechStart": 80.742,
   "speechEnd": 83.134
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "自私挖矿，是把挖到的块先扣住，再择机一次性释放。",
   "spoken": "自私挖矿，是把挖到的块先扣住，再择机一次性释放。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-18.mp3",
   "start": 84.2,
   "dur": 5.208,
   "speechStart": 84.298,
   "speechEnd": 88.571
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "2025 年 9 月，Monero 出现史上最深的 18 块重组。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 9 月，Monero 出现史上最深的 18 块虫组。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-19.mp3",
   "start": 89.628,
   "dur": 5.328,
   "speechStart": 89.726,
   "speechEnd": 94.118
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-20",
   "text": "矿池 Qubic 公开说用了自私挖矿。",
   "spoken": "矿池 Qubic 公开说用了自私挖矿。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-20.mp3",
   "start": 95.176,
   "dur": 3.432,
   "speechStart": 95.274,
   "speechEnd": 97.785
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-21",
   "text": "研究者认为，它的日均算力没有达到 51%。",
   "spoken": "研究者认为，它的日均算力没有达到百分之 51。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-21.mp3",
   "start": 98.828,
   "dur": 4.68,
   "speechStart": 98.926,
   "speechEnd": 102.664
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-22",
   "text": "交易所要按租算力的成本和充值金额，定确认数，设单笔和单日上限。",
   "spoken": "交易所要按租算力的成本和充值金额，定确认数，设单笔和单日上限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-22.mp3",
   "start": 103.728,
   "dur": 6.48,
   "speechStart": 103.826,
   "speechEnd": 109.361
  },
  {
